# HP50g stock ARMToolbox launch.
# SD contains only HPCLANG.HP. Copy the selected transfer file into HOME so
# the stock firmware materializes the HPHP49-C transfer envelope as a native
# calculator object. Recall that HOME variable, then run it through ARMToolbox
# PrRUN.
2000 chord lshift files
4200 capture files
4500 tap up
4800 tap f6
6500 capture sd
6900 tap enter
7600 capture sd-payload
8000 tap f2
9200 capture copy-destination
9500 tap down
9800 tap f6
11600 capture copy-result
12100 tap on
13000 capture home
13400 tap var
14500 capture vars
14900 tap f1
16000 capture payload-recalled
16500 chord rshift two
17750 capture lib
18100 tap f1
19400 capture armtoolbox
19800 tap f1
20100 monitor
